{"id": "DfXLaUix7H6", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Papa ko aaj bhi nahi pata mixtape kya hoti hai… par poori gali ko bete ka gaana unhone hi sunaya 🎧🥹\n\nJodhpur ki neeli galiyon mein ek ladka stepwell ki seedhiyon pe baith ke copy mein rap likhta tha. Log hanste the.\nHaathon mein chhaale pad gaye, dost ek-ek karke chhoot gaye, raatein Bandra ki khidki pe kat gayi.\nBachpan mein Papa ko ek khilona kaali gaadi di thi, aur ek vaada.\nAaj wahi kaali gaadi dukaan ke bahar khadi hai, gende ki maala ke saath… aur Papa phone uthake poori gali ko uska gaana suna rahe hain.\nPeeche deewar pe bas ek naam: whysoKai. 💙\n\nwhysoKai ka “Subtle Starboy” (MTV Hustle 5, Apna Homeground) sirf ek desi hip hop track nahi, har us chhote shehar ke rapper ki kahani hai jisne copy se stage tak ka safar akele tay kiya. Jodhpur ka ladka, poore desh ka starboy 🔥\n\n🎵 Subtle Starboy · @whysokai (Hustle 5, Apna Homeground)\n\nUs dost ko bhejo jo aaj bhi raat ko gaane likhta hai… aur us papa ko jo samajhte nahi, par sabko sunate hain 💙\n\n#whysokai #hustle5 #jodhpur", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793887023, "like_count": 10872, "comment_count": 66, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1564859145689690a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 68.63, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQM8BMlPhfnDqfITWE7pkN91dReIPJywRXf2vP65lEaPdyu6tFRiiXClvNNG-XrfgM3smJ-todhQ2lMwnwJDzxAPH3fijaVlZkJ5wvg.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=j4ZGcG5ppsgQ7kNvw